{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, process it, take it and move to destination, else approach it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
    "BT": {
